{"PageNumber":264,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ يَـٰٓإِبۡلِيسُ مَا لَكَ أَلَّا تَكُونَ مَعَ ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ يَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لِيسُ مَا لَكَ أَلَّا تَكُونَ مَعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>جِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ لَمۡ أَكُن لِّأَسۡجُدَ لِبَشَرٍ خَلَقۡتَهُۥ مِن صَلۡصَٰلٖ مِّنۡ حَمَإٖ مَّسۡنُونٖ","TajweedText":"قَالَ لَمْ أَك<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ُن ل</tajweed>ِّأَسْجُدَ لِبَشَرٍ خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ص</tajweed>َلْصَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>لٍ م</tajweed>ِّنْ حَمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>إٍ م</tajweed>َّسْن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَٱخۡرُجۡ مِنۡهَا فَإِنَّكَ رَجِيمٞ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>خْرُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed> مِنْهَا فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ رَج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيۡكَ ٱللَّعۡنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ عَلَيْكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>لَّعْنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبِّ فَأَنظِرۡنِيٓ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ يُبۡعَثُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبِّ فَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ِرْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ يُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>عَث<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَإِنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُنظَرِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلۡوَقۡتِ ٱلۡمَعۡلُومِ","TajweedText":"إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْوَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَعْل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبِّ بِمَآ أَغۡوَيۡتَنِي لَأُزَيِّنَنَّ لَهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَأُغۡوِيَنَّهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبِّ بِم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَغْوَيْتَنِى لَأُزَيِّنَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ لَهُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَلَأُغْوِيَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنۡهُمُ ٱلۡمُخۡلَصِينَ","TajweedText":"إِلَّا عِبَادَكَ مِنْهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُخْلَص<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ هَٰذَا صِرَٰطٌ عَلَيَّ مُسۡتَقِيمٌ","TajweedText":"قَالَ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا صِر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>طٌ عَلَىَّ مُسْتَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ عِبَادِي لَيۡسَ لَكَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ سُلۡطَٰنٌ إِلَّا مَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلۡغَاوِينَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ عِبَادِى لَيْسَ لَكَ عَلَيْهِمْ سُلْطَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نٌ إِلَّا مَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّبَعَكَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَاو<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ لَمَوۡعِدُهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ جَهَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَ لَمَوْعِدُهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَهَا سَبۡعَةُ أَبۡوَٰبٖ لِّكُلِّ بَابٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ جُزۡءٞ مَّقۡسُومٌ","TajweedText":"لَهَا سَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>عَةُ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>بٍ ل</tajweed>ِّكُلِّ بَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٍ م</tajweed>ِّنْهُمْ جُزْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ءٌ م</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>س<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ وَعُيُونٍ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَّقِينَ فِى جَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ و</tajweed>َعُي<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ٱدۡخُلُوهَا بِسَلَٰمٍ ءَامِنِينَ","TajweedText":"ٱ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>خُلُوهَا بِسَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مٍ ءَامِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٦</span>","End":"٤٦","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":47,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَزَعۡنَا مَا فِي صُدُورِهِم مِّنۡ غِلٍّ إِخۡوَٰنًا عَلَىٰ سُرُرٖ مُّتَقَٰبِلِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَزَعْنَا مَا فِى صُدُورِه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ِم م</tajweed>ِّنْ غِلٍّ إِخْو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>نًا عَلَىٰ سُرُ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٍ م</tajweed>ُّتَقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٧</span>","End":"٤٧","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":48,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَا يَمَسُّهُمۡ فِيهَا نَصَبٞ وَمَا هُم مِّنۡهَا بِمُخۡرَجِينَ","TajweedText":"لَا يَمَسُّهُمْ فِيهَا نَصَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٌ و</tajweed>َمَا ه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهَا بِمُخْرَج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٨</span>","End":"٤٨","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":49,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞نَبِّئۡ عِبَادِيٓ أَنِّيٓ أَنَا ٱلۡغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","TajweedText":"۞ نَبِّئْ عِبَاد<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَفُورُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٤٩</span>","End":"٤٩","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":50,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَنَّ عَذَابِي هُوَ ٱلۡعَذَابُ ٱلۡأَلِيمُ","TajweedText":"وَأَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ عَذَابِى هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَذَابُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٥٠</span>","End":"٥٠","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَبِّئۡهُمۡ عَن ضَيۡفِ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ","TajweedText":"وَنَبِّئْهُمْ عَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ض</tajweed>َيْفِ إِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>ر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مَ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false}]}